# Cookie-session examples. Log in with your own development credentials using
# a cookie-aware client; see ../testing.md. Never commit passwords or cookies.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@organizationId = d0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### Current identity
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/me

### Leased numbers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/numbers?limit=20&offset=0

### Message metadata (no bodies)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/messages?limit=20&offset=0

### Wallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/billing/wallet

### Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/billing/ledger?limit=20&offset=0

### Completed orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/orders?status=completed&limit=20&offset=0

### Payment history
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/billing/payments?limit=20&offset=0

### Decrypt one owned message; use an ID from the metadata response
@messageId = PASTE_MESSAGE_ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/messages/{{messageId}}
